<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">3.1<FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</FONT><U>Representations
