<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">(b)<FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</FONT>From
